{
  "source": "Prompts/the-next-token-2.mp4",
  "duration": 163.631,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.94,
      "text": "AI builds an answer one token at a time, calculating probabilities for the next tokens."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.84,
      "end": 9.8,
      "text": "Pauseed at this open token, the AI generates a probability list."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.38,
      "end": 12.52,
      "text": "Spot leads the packet 22%."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.95,
      "end": 15.68,
      "text": "But AI doesn't always pick the highest probability token."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.26,
      "end": 18.82,
      "text": "To understand why, we'll look at sampling and temperature."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.8,
      "end": 24.52,
      "text": "Because the highest mathematical odds do not automatically lock in the AI's final decision,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.9,
      "end": 28.32,
      "text": "we have to look closely at the underlying mechanisms driving this choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.32,
      "end": 33.22,
      "text": "Having the highest probability on the board does not guarantee that token will win the spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.88,
      "end": 40.64,
      "text": "A 22% probability means AI would pick Spot about 22 times out of 100 tries, on average, if the odds stay the same."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.16,
      "end": 41.96,
      "text": "That's called sampling."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.1,
      "end": 44.62,
      "text": "This board shows how odds play out."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.2,
      "end": 47.26,
      "text": "On the left, base probabilities remain unchanged."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.04,
      "end": 49.42,
      "text": "On the right, five separate simulations."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.32,
      "end": 52.62,
      "text": "Each pick is a fresh attempt to fill that single blink."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.32,
      "end": 56.12,
      "text": "Despite the highest starting odds, Spot was picked once."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.12,
      "end": 58.76,
      "text": "Another five picks could turn out entirely different."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.44,
      "end": 62.16,
      "text": "While probability dictates the distribution over a long period,"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.6,
      "end": 67.28,
      "text": "randomness plays a crucial active role in the micro-moment of generating a single token."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.98,
      "end": 70.56,
      "text": "If the AI chose the most likely token every single time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.94,
      "end": 73.62,
      "text": "the resulting text would become highly repetitive and robotic."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.44,
      "end": 76.52,
      "text": "Giving the less likely tokens a chance to be selected,"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.0,
      "end": 79.44,
      "text": "injects natural variance into the AI speech patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.36,
      "end": 81.68,
      "text": "And each choice cascades."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.48,
      "end": 84.5,
      "text": "Picking Spot creates one specific sentence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.98,
      "end": 90.18,
      "text": "but picking a word like Rex sends the rest of the generated paragraph down a completely different conceptual branch."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.96,
      "end": 96.1,
      "text": "A single randomized choice at a critical junction alters the entire trajectory of the AI's final output."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.86,
      "end": 98.92,
      "text": "In chat apps, it's already set for you behind the scenes."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.64,
      "end": 102.4,
      "text": "This chart shows starting odds based on training and prompt context."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.98,
      "end": 104.92,
      "text": "Spot begins at 22%."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.92,
      "end": 109.84,
      "text": "Lowering temperature concentrates odds onto likely tokens, raising Spot to 36%."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.84,
      "end": 114.54,
      "text": "Higher temperature spreads those odds, dropping Spot to 16%,"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.54,
      "end": 117.02,
      "text": "granting less likely names of fighting chance."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.08,
      "end": 121.8,
      "text": "Temperature acts as a dial for predictability versus variety,"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.26,
      "end": 125.5,
      "text": "physically reshaping the risk profile of the AI's next move."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.38,
      "end": 130.46,
      "text": "Tracking Spot across all three scenarios summarizes the mechanic,"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.08,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "starting at 22%, peaking at 36% under low temperature,"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.6,
      "end": 138.08,
      "text": "and dropping to 16% under high temperature."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.68,
      "end": 143.48,
      "text": "Meanwhile, that other category simply aggregates the microscopic probabilities"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.48,
      "end": 145.84,
      "text": "of every remaining word in the AI's vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.24,
      "end": 150.58,
      "text": "Temperature reshapes the probabilities used to pick the next token."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.08,
      "end": 152.6,
      "text": "It doesn't change what the model learned."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.52,
      "end": 155.04,
      "text": "So remember the core lesson here."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.68,
      "end": 157.32,
      "text": "The best chance isn't a guarantee."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.28,
      "end": 159.86,
      "text": "Different choices, same learned weights."
    }
  ],
